1188
01:25:42,263 --> 01:25:46,141
 <i>Es JEFAZ-0-69 </i>

1189
01:25:46,308 --> 01:25:48,519
 <i>Pero, Arty, debes salir. </i>

1190
01:25:48,686 --> 01:25:49,979
Tú debes formar un ejército.

1191
