1289
01:35:05,951 --> 01:35:07,744
 <i>Anál nathrach, </i>

1290
01:35:07,911 --> 01:35:09,079
 <i>orth ́ bháis ́s bethad, </i>

1291
01:35:09,871 --> 01:35:11,498
 <i>do chél dénmha. </i>

1292
